"Component: Wind Wall": {
  "index": "2",
  "category": "sorcery",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Wind Wall"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "I've plucked arrows out of my armor (and limbs) for the last time! I've found a way to create a dense barrier of whirling wind surrounding me. With this wind, I can "
        },
        {
          "text": "redirect arrows and other projectiles",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " that are launched at me. If I increase the power of the wind, I can even cause it to reflect the projectile back at its source! This will teach the first skeleton I see a lesson.\n\nI've noticed that this spell may be somewhat "
        },
        {
          "text": "unreliable against the attacks of particularly powerful enemies",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".  Still, some sounds better than none."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
    {
      "type": "spell_part",
      "location": "mna:components/wind_wall"
    }
  ]
}